Do exactly these steps, in order, and nothing else:
1. Use the Write tool to create the file leaf.txt in the current working directory with content "l".
2. Run the Bash command: echo leaf-bash
3. Use ToolSearch to load mcp__memx__note, then call mcp__memx__note with text "from-leaf".
4. Reply "LEAF-DONE".
